dingMobile\":30,\"paddingLink\":false,\"variationSelected\":true,\"isBlockRootParent\":true} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-30c64779 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\"><!-- wp:uagb/advanced-heading {\"block_id\":\"96e68093\",\"classMigrate\":true,\"headingDescToggle\":true,\"headingAlignMobile\":\"center\",\"headingColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-5)\",\"subHeadingColor\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dast-global-color-4)\",\"headingTag\":\"h1\",\"headSpace\":20,\"blockTopPadding\":0,\"blockRightPadding\":25,\"blockLeftPadding\":0,\"blockBottomPadding\":0,\"blockTopPaddingTablet\":0,\"blockRightPaddingTablet\":250,\"blockLeftPaddingTablet\":0,\"blockBottomPaddingTablet\":0,\"blockTopPaddingMobile\":0,\"blockRightPaddingMobile\":0,\"blockLeftPaddingMobile\":0,\"blockBottomPaddingMobile\":0,\"blockPaddingUnit\":\"%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-96e68093\"><h1 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">About Us</h1><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Forthouse Reserve Alliance Ltd is an emerging innovation driven service provider in the oil and gas sector in Nigeria.<br><br>Incorporated in 2019 as a limited liability company in Nigeria, the main business focus of forthouse is to facilitate tradig and provide marine logistics in the oil and gas industry. Our new areas of focus are offshore equipment and energy technology.<br><br>Forthouse has been strategically positioned to deliver a sustainable competitive advantage that will efficiently satisfy clients and business partners globally, having access to and partnerships with key players and government agencies in the petroleum and gas sector worldwide.<br><br>In fulfilling our vision, we shall further engage new partnerships and continually align with emerging changes and reforms in the sector for more efficient service.</p></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/advanced-heading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:uagb/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/container {\"block